# Binary assets: never line-ending-normalize. (core.autocrlf=true on this
# machine has mangled binary content in the past when the 8-bit heuristic
# misses NUL bytes — e.g. palette-indexed ICO rasters.)
*.ico  binary
*.png  binary
*.avif binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.webmanifest binary
*.cdr  binary
